<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Teeru – Expense Tracker</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f9f9ff;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background-color: #5B2EE6;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 40px;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo img {
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #5B2EE6, #8667F2);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* Features */
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        .feature-card {
            text-align: center;
            background: #f6f4ff;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            color: #5B2EE6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9ff;
        }

        .about h2 {
            color: #5B2EE6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about p {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #5B2EE6;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .hero p { font-size: 1rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Teeru Logo">
            <h2>Teeru</h2>
        </div>
        <nav>
            <a href="/login">Log In</a>
            <a href="/signup">Sign Up</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Take Control of Your Expenses</h1>
        <p>Teeru helps you track, manage, and save smarter. Start your financial journey today.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>💰 Budget Tracking</h3>
            <p>Set your monthly budget and get instant alerts when you’re nearing the limit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>📊 Expense Reports</h3>
            <p>View detailed reports of your spending habits and manage your finances effectively.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>🔔 Smart Notifications</h3>
            <p>Get timely reminders and spending tips to stay within your budget.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>🌍 Multi-language</h3>
            <p>Choose between English and Dzongkha for a personalized experience.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
        <h2>About Teeru</h2>
        <p>
            Teeru is a simple yet powerful expense tracker designed for everyone who wants to manage their personal finances effectively. 
            Track your expenses, set goals, and make smarter spending decisions with real-time notifications and insightful reports.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        © 2025 Teeru – Expense Tracker | Version 1.0 Prototype
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
